{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4000_situation", "source_sha256": "c892c3116cb2e59b25b69d0a756bdb71bc8d252f5a24986f190e1e714c9cdddb", "ja": "人気B級グルメ特番　収録後", "zh": "人气平民美食特别节目　录影后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4000_place", "source_sha256": "3d44ee6c2347f1b74d7e4433ec4f514493709abf46436b561e0c953429446f25", "ja": "収録スタジオ袖", "zh": "摄影棚侧边", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4001_037nao", "source_sha256": "884551f8a1f18114493943f6ad55b10f8de9af9389470853da0e8bbd2fd125ab", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れ様ですー。\nあの～、ちょっといいですか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，辛苦你了──\n那个～可以打扰一下吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4002_p", "source_sha256": "4088692d9c43f6e5d064dd38ada3069cc2bb31c9db8b0476431898f91b7effc8", "ja": "うん？　どうしたんだ、奈緒？", "zh": "嗯？怎么了，奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4003_037nao", "source_sha256": "090b452677c045c183199bfb67ae379cf827ce965a3dedde632f4f7e399212a8", "ja": "ずーっと収録やったし、{$P$}さんも\nお腹減ってるんちゃうかなーと思いまして。", "zh": "因为一～直都在录影，我想说{$P$}\n先生肚子是不是也饿了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4004_037nao", "source_sha256": "f390548a4b0777baf7070cf572cf1e4629c5ef7f8a8923cdda1e327434c15b07", "ja": "さっきの収録で新しいお好み焼きのレシピ、紹介して\nたやないですか？　私、事務所で作ってあげますよ！", "zh": "刚刚拍摄时不是有介绍大阪烧的新食谱吗？\n我在事务所做给你吃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4005_p", "source_sha256": "6efc6d4d3ddd5d38b90b439431be42ea47677eb9df820916b3787cc731b3ac16", "ja": "へぇ、奈緒のお好み焼きか。\nそれは楽しみだな。", "zh": "哦，奈绪做的大阪烧啊？\n真令人期待呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4006_037nao", "source_sha256": "1d49710fb69d8f638656b65d2b7f82ab4692f7c07446840d1779a3740385ecfe", "ja": "任しといてください♪　ま、美味しいお好みを\n焼くには、レシピも大事やけど……。", "zh": "交给我吧♪不过，要做美味的大阪烧，\n食谱虽然重要……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4007_037nao", "source_sha256": "615f04972afa718705a38d5974fa6f959054ff8f6e119b34cb41ae0f348010fc", "ja": "何より大事なコツがあるんですー。\nなんやと思います、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "但有更重要的秘诀──\n你觉得是什么，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4008", "source_sha256": "e2955df744bd89c12e73d502915cfe0fad66f539eb78f9297e291137566b8294", "ja": "みんなで食べる", "zh": "大家一起吃", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4009", "source_sha256": "09f78dabfc22b35ea2d6530fc3a5d90b8863794ddc55ff87330702481984e1fe", "ja": "少しずつ焼く", "zh": "慢慢煎", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4010", "source_sha256": "3102cc47e3df69c71e5dcb9eefa26a3c8619782245d99621ecd032eac0ccf1fd", "ja": "ひっくり返さない", "zh": "不要翻面", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4100_p", "source_sha256": "5d1174b6a0bea3648c4c3f78cf4ff0abe807f3221ca325cfd9d6ae9d03b616df", "ja": "えっと……みんなで食べる、とか？", "zh": "呃……大家一起吃之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4101_037nao", "source_sha256": "5a1ff2bc7298125102b3a2ab127a07983a21510a2d451cf8998f259327fb6dd0", "ja": "そうそう、それや！\nやっぱりみんなと食べたら、おいしくなるもんな♪", "zh": "没错没错，就是这个啦！\n和大家一起吃就会变好吃呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4102_037nao", "source_sha256": "2def88aec7cb5e325894fdeaa205002cdba2504e623fc7ff363264c74c369cad", "ja": "って、なんでやねーん！　作るコツ、いうたでしょ！\n……ま、いいです。", "zh": "……呃，什么啦！我不是说制作秘诀吗！\n……算了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4103_037nao", "source_sha256": "275ba609e6809a9025b78d9b08e249dcd283ad55ebe7418892fe42de34e8cca1", "ja": "せっかくやから、みんなでお好み焼きパーティーや！\nええやろ、{$P$}さん？", "zh": "既然都要做，就找大家一起开大阪烧派对吧！\n可以吼，{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4104_p", "source_sha256": "6a3d3ab1525fd5140b042f68e40d2da4b3f98cf1de5b01492d4df7c83c1ee0cf", "ja": "ああ、もちろん。みんなにも伝えないとな。", "zh": "当然，得要去通知大家才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4200_p", "source_sha256": "be29cd1a0b1ca5e1c8f0be69e7b7923316338e7045a6dbef8d993ae910727e09", "ja": "ええっと、確か番組でも言ってたような……\n少しずつ、ひっくり返すこと。そうだったよな？", "zh": "我想想，节目中似乎有提到……\n是要一点一点慢慢翻面，没错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4201_037nao", "source_sha256": "2ee77d4c09c433ea1461682ba0dbaa7cfd9a50a28ebaeb6b55db8d0e96bad7b1", "ja": "おお～。さっすが{$P$}さん、\n記憶力ええな！　正解です！", "zh": "喔喔～不愧是{$P$}先生，\n记忆力真好！答对了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4202_037nao", "source_sha256": "7e89424da174790e1662c209f067609f163af354acf32b84f1af7d0f5eb30658", "ja": "正解した{$P$}さんのために、\n私が心を込めて、一枚ずつ焼きますね～！", "zh": "为了答对的{$P$}先生，\n我会一块一块用心煎的嘿～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4300_p", "source_sha256": "728ea7188ac5404cf211cfa3df54d79c45efcc1bc3d111888bafebdaf891b53b", "ja": "ええっと、確か番組でも言ってたような……。\nひっくり返……さない！　だっけ？", "zh": "我想想，节目中似乎有提到……\n不要……翻面！是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4301_037nao", "source_sha256": "752b5f4eb63916ab257b3fc78c24170cce08be0b7fbc3458b3c848cc631409ee", "ja": "あのなぁ、{$P$}さん……。\nそれ半分焼いてないやん！　お好みナマ焼きやん！", "zh": "我说啊，{$P$}先生……\n这样就只有半熟了！变成大阪生烧了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_4000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_4302_037nao", "source_sha256": "2db94b5c2d4f328f7ecffda82682bc8d5a44eea76a8c0ac0099d80deb381e41c", "ja": "どーしてもっていうなら、作ってもいいですけど……\nお腹壊しても知りませんよ？", "zh": "如果你无论如何都想吃的话，我是可以做啦……\n但吃坏肚子也不关我的事嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
